      <div class="chead rise"><p class="kicker">The atelier</p><h2 class="big">Who makes it</h2>
        <p class="plain">One designer, Ange Nicole Mukundwa, and three workshops: one for frames, one for covers, one for lamps. The materials change with every client, so the workshops are named for what they make, not what they make it from. This is the kind of work that happens there.</p></div>
      <blockquote class="pull">I wanted a house that could feel inherited on its first day. Light was the one thing it could own.<cite>Ange Nicole Mukundwa, founder</cite></blockquote>
